  "post_content": "<p>(32 fotos) Hasta este domingo, 9 de abril, se puede visitar la exposici&oacute;n &#39;M&uacute;sica, on comen&ccedil;a ella i on acabe jo?&#39; de la ondense Irene Garcia Molina (Lluna Llunera) en el Coworking Dinamic de Benic&agrave;ssim, en la playa del Torre&oacute;n, junto a la torre de San Vicente.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_2694.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En la mulitudinaria inuaguraci&oacute;n, que sirvi&oacute; para iniciar la actividad mensual &#39;First artistic weekend&#39; actuaron tambi&eacute;n la guitarrista de jaz Xiomara Abello y la cantante Elena Rius. El artista multidisciplinar Agust&iacute;n Falomir ley&oacute; unos poemas.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2661.jpg\" alt=\"img_2661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2662.jpg\" alt=\"img_2662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2663.jpg\" alt=\"img_2663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2664.jpg\" alt=\"img_2664\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2665.jpg\" alt=\"img_2665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunalluneracoworkingdinamycbenicassim/img_2666.jpg\" alt=\"img_2666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expollunallune